      "privatePressure": "先取军饷可能牺牲证据，先保人证又可能误前线。",
      "keyLeverage": "把合法取得的现银划往军前并登记责任",
      "defaultPrepare": "准备军饷划拨和商产清册",
      "defaultCommit": "只划拨合法取得且有清册的现银",
      "dialogueSeeds": [
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n6.zhejiang_governor.01",
          "text": "“先把可划军前的现银列清，别把未查明的商产一概当军饷。”",
          "purpose": "PROBE_OR_FRAME",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.shen_yishi_person_and_assets",
            "obj.local_four_boxes",
            "obj.military_dispatch_channel"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.zhejiang_governor"
          ]
        },
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n6.zhejiang_governor.02",
          "text": "“人证、账册与军饷不能同时保全，至少要留下谁取舍了什么。”",
          "purpose": "BARGAIN_OR_THREAT",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.shen_yishi_person_and_assets",
            "obj.local_four_boxes",
            "obj.military_dispatch_channel"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.zhejiang_governor"
          ]
        },
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n6.zhejiang_governor.03",
          "text": "“查封清册若没有见证，我不会在军饷收讫上替省府担名。”",
          "purpose": "HANDOFF_OR_COMMITMENT",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.shen_yishi_person_and_assets",
            "obj.local_four_boxes",
            "obj.military_dispatch_channel"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.zhejiang_governor"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "privateOpening": "胡宗宪公开只知道查封、军饷和商产同时逼近，不能据此宣称账册有几路。先取现银还是先保人证，会改变后续能证明到哪一步。",
